label ch30_50:
    [   0] m "[player], how much do you read?"
    [   1] m "It's way too easy to neglect reading books..."
    [   2] m "If you don't read much, it almost feels like a chore, compared to all the other entertainment we have."
    [   3] m "But once you get into a good book, it's like magic...you get swept away."
    [   4] m "I think doing some reading before bed every night is a pretty easy way to make your life a little bit better."
    [   5] m "It helps you get good sleep, and it's really good for your imagination..."
    [   6] m "It's not hard at all to just pick some random book that's short and captivating."
    [   7] m "Before you know it, you might be a pretty avid reader!"
    [   8] m "Wouldn't that be wonderful?"
    [   9] m "And the two of us could talk about the latest book you're reading...that sounds super amazing."
